   "he": "״מְקוּדָּשׁ מְקוּדָּשׁ״ תְּרֵי זִימְנֵי לְמָה לִי? דִּכְתִיב: ״מִקְרָאֵי קוֹדֶשׁ״.",
   "en": "The Gemara further asks: «Why do I» need the people to declare: It is «sanctified;» it is «sanctified, twice?» The Gemara answers that the reason is «that it is written: “Sacred convocations”» (Leviticus 23:2) in the plural, which indicates that they must announce it twice."
